  "rule": "Binding endpoint = median (P14); mean disclosed. Per cell (m>=30): m3_median_viable = M3 median CI_low(1s)>0; m3_mean_viable = M3 mean CI_low(1s)>0; m3_beats_rm3 = (M3-RM3) independent-contrast median CI_low(1s)>0 (contrast_ci, mirrors EXP-060 champion-vs-random); m3_lead_cell = all three. SUBSTRATE_LEAD_FOUND iff m3_lead_cell composes P11 (>=5 cells/>=3 instruments). ARTIFACT_CONFIRMED iff m3_median_viable composes P11 AND the lead fails P11 (skew: mean not viable; and/or redundancy: does not beat RM3). The mean and RM3 only make the lead criterion stricter (P14-consistent: never declare viable on the mean).",
